class_name MainUI
extends Control

## Sleek Industrial Dark Pro Studio Controller for Hashcat Intelligence Studio.
## Coordinates Tri-Zone layout, GpuRack hardware switches, PerformanceGraph vector curve,
## pure unconstrained execution, Hash Auto-Detector wizard, and fail-safe dual-language localization.

